Eip3009Sigil::initializeWithMultiplexer
├── given a config is installed
│   ├── it should mark the instance initialized
│   ├── it should expose the token, domain separator, and cap via config()
│   ├── it should expose the payee via payeeAllowed()
│   └── it should emit SigilSet with (id, multiplexer, account)
├── given the config is keyed by multiplexer
│   └── a different multiplexer's view reads back unconfigured
└── given a re-init with a different payee allowlist
    └── it should REPLACE the prior config (stale payee cleared, new payee set)
